  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing -- Validate-DeployedEnvironment.ps1's 5 effect-probe checks are already correct; DS-1b explicitly frames this as the SAME probe-authoring work as tasks 170-180, done once. Extension -- converging this port with the already-built probe infrastructure (rather than a parallel implementation) is the direct application of CLAUDE.md §11's reuse-over-new-component principle. Cost-of-doing-nothing -- this validation runner cannot execute under Option D's zero-shell main site; H13's acceptance gate loses its 5 effect-probe checks entirely.</notes>

